{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "5_01_045_23",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:0827db7a3819de1bea08d4abf6db7354da0acb63fcae54e2a9308c6092805aea",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:5_01_045_23:5_01_045_23_a:cmd-000015:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5573b89ba3d3abf3ae50862e580dd3cd25ec7bb704141c51717563359395748c",
      "text": "地方的工作，辛苦啦～。虽说发生了很多事，\n但总的来说还是挺开心的吧～",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_045_23:5_01_045_23_a:cmd-000020:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c07db93e535f52018efff6c483357a29347e5015c7094600b4300687f981c2ad",
      "text": "●●●●プロデューサー，给。\n这个请拿去吧～。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_045_23:5_01_045_23_a:cmd-000024:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6f329e9f281b1f3a3a4345f6880c4fb58a2fe0aca5f80098a2aa2a0aebe0a926",
      "text": "虽然挺老套的，\n但不是常说累了的时候就要吃点甜食嘛～？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_045_23:5_01_045_23_a:cmd-000029:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2d258c5514c8cc36e3fc76d9481edf25156fccefa4eb46068a6f25050a020850",
      "text": "这份冰淇淋，就当是我的一点感谢心意吧。\n今后也请多多关照咯～。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_045_23:5_01_045_23_a:cmd-000033:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:41f3450396ea7ea4ce5fa7c1ecefd20e9fd3ba9fe304b5e7abab86e1182a18bf",
      "text": "是巧克力味的冰淇淋呢！\n谢谢款待。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_045_23:5_01_045_23_a:cmd-000037:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9badbb0aa51c7e21ef0b8b68f2e78017bcdb24d9dd38cb00deb77e548c3a31ba",
      "text": "嗯。想着送给制作人，\n刚才在月台上顺手买的～。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_045_23:5_01_045_23_a:cmd-000041:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a5849ae743c47fded755f38bb1291ab6bb2db21bd612dd7b530b351b2cefc239",
      "text": "谢谢你，想乐先生！\n那我就马上开动……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_045_23:5_01_045_23_a:cmd-000044:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:819d9345dc0ed998520fb0506527864f7c637f6bea7d8306014de0064bd1caef",
      "text": "好、好硬！勺子根本插不进去！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_045_23:5_01_045_23_a:cmd-000049:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:136dec7a55103d98f93b222ac98b9c3112016acad3e09a77e1a2ebd78815a2bf",
      "text": "听说这玩意儿以超硬出名呢——。\n哇——，勺子真的完全插不进去呢～。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_045_23:5_01_045_23_a:cmd-000056:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:772b7918faba1d4b741e99e3a2cf13cc193cd1fe33baa2694717554f80ab5366",
      "text": "总算明白为什么会出名了——。\n这种硬度，搞不好超乎想象呢～。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_045_23:5_01_045_23_a:cmd-000061:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:41b21a6c832e28850e373ed79f7630544e6c91d36a44d291361e066555f032d2",
      "text": "这个看来一时半会儿吃不了呢。\n稍微等一会儿吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_045_23:5_01_045_23_a:cmd-000065:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:92e79c4ae2eebed07fac6b1dab11581fccb1b8f68334ac7e4a1d95de6e0d53a5",
      "text": "也是呢～。\n在化开之前我们先聊聊天吧～。",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
